{"id":"enfrentar","lemma":"enfrentar","pos":"verb","rank":2681,"glosses":["to confront, to face (can also be translated with deal with, tackle, etc.)","to pit something against something else","to pit two things against each other"],"ipa":"/enfɾenˈtaɾ/","conjugation":{"indicative":{"present":{"1s":"enfrento","2s":"enfrentas","3s":"enfrenta","1p":"enfrentamos","2p":"enfrentáis","3p":"enfrentan"},"imperfect":{"1s":"enfrentaba","2s":"enfrentabas","3s":"enfrentaba","1p":"enfrentábamos","2p":"enfrentabais","3p":"enfrentaban"},"preterite":{"1s":"enfrenté","2s":"enfrentaste","3s":"enfrentó","1p":"enfrentamos","2p":"enfrentasteis","3p":"enfrentaron"},"future":{"1s":"enfrentaré","2s":"enfrentarás","3s":"enfrentará","1p":"enfrentaremos","2p":"enfrentaréis","3p":"enfrentarán"},"conditional":{"1s":"enfrentaría","2s":"enfrentarías","3s":"enfrentaría","1p":"enfrentaríamos","2p":"enfrentaríais","3p":"enfrentarían"}},"subjunctive":{"present":{"1s":"enfrente","2s":"enfrentes","3s":"enfrente","1p":"enfrentemos","2p":"enfrentéis","3p":"enfrenten"},"imperfect":{"1s":"enfrentara","2s":"enfrentaras","3s":"enfrentara","1p":"enfrentáramos","2p":"enfrentarais","3p":"enfrentaran"}},"imperative":{"affirmative":{"2s":"enfrenta","3s":"enfrente","1p":"enfrentemos","2p":"enfrentad","3p":"enfrenten"},"negative":{"2s":"enfrentes","3s":"enfrente","1p":"enfrentemos","2p":"enfrentéis","3p":"enfrenten"}}},"nonFinite":{"gerund":"enfrentando","participle":"enfrentado"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/c/c9/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Wikipedian-walker-enfrentar.wav","formAudio":{"enfrente":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/e/e9/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Wikipedian-walker-enfrente.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Debes enfrentar la realidad.","en":"You should face reality.","words":[{"g":"to owe","l":"deber"},null,{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"reality"}]},{"text":"No sabemos a lo que nos enfrentamos.","en":"We don't know what we're up against.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/301756","words":[{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to know, to understand","l":"saber"},null,null,{"g":"that"},{"g":"us"},null],"phrases":[[2,4,"a la"]]},{"text":"Ella estaba lista para enfrentar su destino.","en":"She was ready to face her fate.","words":[{"g":"she"},{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},{"g":"list, roll"},{"g":"for"},null,{"g":"his / her / your"},{"g":"destiny, fate"}]},{"text":"Quiero ver lo que estoy enfrentando.","en":"I want to see what I'm up against.","words":[{"g":"to desire","l":"querer"},{"g":"to see, to spot"},null,null,{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},null],"phrases":[[2,4,"what, that which"]]},{"text":"Él enfrentó al peligro valientemente.","en":"He was brave in the face of danger.","words":[{"g":"he"},null,{"g":"to the"},{"g":"danger, peril"},{"g":"valiantly, bravely"}]}]}